==== <translate><!--T:1--> Holy Spirit, fill me!</translate> ==== 
<translate><!--T:23--> Pray for the Holy Spirit to work in you and through you.</translate>

==== <translate><!--T:2--> Jesus, protect me!</translate> ==== 
<translate><!--T:24--> Put yourself under the protection of Jesus' blood and sacrifice.</translate>

==== <translate><!--T:3--> Heavenly Father, give me whatever gift I need today.</translate> ====
<translate><!--T:25--> God can give you everything you'll need this day.</translate>

==== <translate><!--T:4--> Thank you, God, for my life and everything you're giving me.</translate> ====
<translate><!--T:26--> Say thanks in and for everything.</translate>


== <translate><!--T:5--> Put on the whole armor of God</translate> == 

* {{Translatable template|Italic|<translate><!--T:6-->
Helmet of Salvation</translate>:}} <translate><!--T:7-->
God, protect and change my thoughts.</translate>
* {{Translatable template|Italic|<translate><!--T:8-->
Breastplate of Righteousness</translate>:}} <translate><!--T:9-->
Thank you, God, for your grace by which I'm saved.</translate>
* {{Translatable template|Italic|<translate><!--T:10-->
Belt of Truth</translate>:}} <translate><!--T:11-->
God, help me to speak truth and to live according to your truth.</translate>
* {{Translatable template|Italic|<translate><!--T:12-->
Shoes of Readiness</translate>:}} <translate><!--T:13-->
God, help me to see situations where I can share about you and help me to do it.</translate>
* {{Translatable template|Italic|<translate><!--T:14-->
Shield of Faith</translate>:}} <translate><!--T:15-->
God I trust you. Let my faith in you grow.</translate>
* {{Translatable template|Italic|<translate><!--T:16-->
Sword / God's Word</translate>:}} <translate><!--T:17-->
God, help me to understand your word better and to use it.</translate>

<translate><!--T:18-->
(Ephesians 6:10-17)</translate>

